WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.918
ATSUKO OKATSUKA:
 Keep your head down,

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.253
and blend in
as much as possible.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.838
At least, that's what
my family would tell me.

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:07.590
And then they named me
Atsuko Okatsuka.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:12.137
And then they went on
to choose English names
for themselves.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:14.556
Thanks, Mom!

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.475
Or Linda.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:20.019
My grandma raised me,

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.480
so I didn't really hang out
with people my age growing up.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.607
People are always like,
"Atsuko, what's wrong with you?"

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:26.568
Someone 50 years older
than me

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:29.279
taught me how to socialize,
okay?

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.781
Whenever I would try
to make friends as a kid,

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:35.618
I was always, like,
telling war stories and stuff.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:39.456
Trying to trade food recipes.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:45.462
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:52.343
My husband and I had
an intruder come to our house.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.053
My fearless husband,
he rushes out,

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.097
starts to shake his hand
in the air like this.

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:58.266
The guy kinda watches this,
freaks out,

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:59.934
and starts to run away.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:01.978
It works.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.147
Different fighting style.

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:05.815
Mind tricks.

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.944
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

